      "Phase399 preserved hard world facts but reconstructed exact-adjacency shared-agenda dialogue.",
      "Phase399 and human-positive Phase370 both used many short paragraphs; paragraph shortness is not the primary separator.",
      "The selected mechanism changes visibility and generation horizon rather than surface quotas."
    ]
  },
